SUMMARY:Know Return: Celebrating the Music of Kansas & Styx
DESCRIPTION:Saturday September 19th\, 2026\nDoors | 6:00 PM\nShow | 7:00 PM \nReserved Mezzanine Seating | $32.65 + Fees\nReserved Balcony Seating | $37.75 + Fees\nReserved Orchestra Seating | $43.35 + Fees  \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n————————————————–\nKnow Return performs today’s most authentic and ambitious tribute to the legendary music of Kansas\, from the hits like Carry On Wayward Son and Dust in the Wind… to deeper cuts like Icarus and Belexes… to prog epics like Closet Chronicles and Song for America.   \nThe band also recreates the timeless music of Styx\, delivering fan favorites from the 70s and 80s with spot-on vocal harmonies and hook-heavy instrumental fireworks.  \nTwo unparalleled tributes…one fun\, high-energy thrill ride back to the glory days of prog and classic rock.    \nCheck out Know Return: Celebrating the Music of Kansas & Styx here!\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/know-return-celebrating-the-music-of-kansas-styx/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/05/KR-Group-photo-1-e1778803759915.jpg
END:VEVENT
